A field of view for screens wider than 4:3 that keeps the view up and down of a 4:3 screen
(Hor+), and the console variable cl_fov, the field of view across the screen in degrees (0, the
default, for the automatic one). Patch Scripts.cmd applies it to FCData/Scripts.pak.

